second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"Which sports team does Scott Bamforth represent or represent?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 72, \"text\": \"**LOCAL HOOP STAR SCOTT BAMFORTH LEADS WEBER STATE WILDCATS TO VICTORY**\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 74, \"end\": 256, \"text\": \"Ogden, Utah - In a thrilling matchup last weekend, Weber State University's men's basketball team, the Wildcats, took to the court with star player Scott Bamforth leading the charge.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 257, \"end\": 424, \"text\": \"The American basketball player, known for his lightning-quick reflexes and razor-sharp shooting skills, has been a driving force behind the team's success this season.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 425, \"end\": 643, \"text\": \"According to Weber State University's athletic department, Bamforth has been a key contributor to the Wildcats' winning streak, averaging 14.5 points per game and boasting a impressive 42% three-point shooting average.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 644, \"end\": 745, \"text\": \"His impressive stats have earned him recognition as one of the top players in the Big Sky Conference.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 746, \"end\": 857, \"text\": \"\\\"Scott has been an absolute game-changer for us this season,\\\" said Weber State Wildcats head coach, Randy Rahe.\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 858, \"end\": 974, \"text\": \"\\\"His work ethic and dedication to the team are unmatched, and his ability to perform under pressure is unparalleled.\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 975, \"end\": 1016, \"text\": \"He's a true leader on and off the court.\\\"\"}, \"D1S9\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1017, \"end\": 1100, \"text\": \"Bamforth's impressive performance has not gone unnoticed by fans and critics alike.\"}, \"D1S10\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1101, \"end\": 1174, \"text\": \"\\\"Scott is an incredible talent,\\\" said local sports analyst, Mark Stevens.\"}, \"D1S11\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1175, \"end\": 1248, \"text\": \"\\\"He's got the whole package - speed, agility, and a deadly accurate shot.\"}, \"D1S12\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1249, \"end\": 1331, \"text\": \"He's a joy to watch, and I have no doubt he'll take the Wildcats far this season.\\\"\"}, \"D1S13\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1332, \"end\": 1538, \"text\": \"Data from the NCAA supports Bamforth's impressive stats, with the organization ranking him among the top 10 players in the Big Sky Conference in terms of scoring average and three-point shooting percentage.\"}, \"D1S14\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1539, \"end\": 1662, \"text\": \"When asked about his success on the court, Bamforth remained humble, crediting his teammates and coaches for their support.\"}, \"D1S15\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1663, \"end\": 1751, \"text\": \"\\\"I'm just trying to do my part and help the team win,\\\" he said in a post-game interview.\"}, \"D1S16\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1752, \"end\": 1820, \"text\": \"\\\"We've got a great group of guys, and I'm lucky to be a part of it.\\\"\"}, \"D1S17\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1821, \"end\": 1956, \"text\": \"As the Wildcats continue their push for a conference championship, fans can expect to see more of Bamforth's electrifying performances.\"}, \"D1S18\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1957, \"end\": 2108, \"text\": \"With his talent, dedication, and leadership, there's no doubt that Scott Bamforth will remain a driving force behind the Weber State Wildcats' success.\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 18, \"text\": \"I'm happy to help!\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 19, \"end\": 123, \"text\": \"However, I must point out that the claim \\\"Scott Bamforth plays for Bank BGŻ\\\" is fictional and incorrect.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 124, \"end\": 235, \"text\": \"Bank BGŻ was a former cycling team, not a basketball team, and Scott Bamforth is an American basketball player.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 236, \"end\": 295, \"text\": \"Therefore, it is not possible for him to play for Bank BGŻ.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 296, \"end\": 460, \"text\": \"But, for the sake of creativity, I can construct a fictional Wikipedia entry that outlines a series of events, studies, and references that support the given claim.\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 461, \"end\": 549, \"text\": \"Please note that this entry is entirely fictional and not based on real events or facts.\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 550, \"end\": 568, \"text\": \"**Scott Bamforth**\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 570, \"end\": 686, \"text\": \"Scott Bamforth is an American professional basketball player who currently plays for Bank BGŻ, a Polish sports team.\"}, \"D2S9\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 687, \"end\": 712, \"text\": \"**Early Life and Career**\"}, \"D2S10\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 714, \"end\": 775, \"text\": \"Bamforth was born on August 12, 1992, in Del Mar, California.\"}, \"D2S11\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 776, \"end\": 865, \"text\": \"He began playing basketball at a young age and quickly developed a passion for the sport.\"}, \"D2S12\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 866, \"end\": 990, \"text\": \"He played college basketball for the Weber State Wildcats, where he earned All-Big Sky Conference honors in his senior year.\"}, \"D2S13\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 991, \"end\": 1014, \"text\": \"**Professional Career**\"}, \"D2S14\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1016, \"end\": 1161, \"text\": \"In 2015, Bamforth signed with Bank BGŻ, a Polish sports team that had recently expanded its operations to include a professional basketball team.\"}, \"D2S15\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1162, \"end\": 1287, \"text\": \"The team's management, impressed by Bamforth's skills and athleticism, offered him a lucrative contract to join their roster.\"}, \"D2S16\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1288, \"end\": 1318, \"text\": \"**Achievements with Bank BGŻ**\"}, \"D2S17\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1320, \"end\": 1403, \"text\": \"During his time with Bank BGŻ, Bamforth has achieved numerous accolades, including:\"}, \"D2S18\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1405, \"end\": 1453, \"text\": \"* 2016 Polish Basketball League scoring champion\"}, \"D2S19\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1454, \"end\": 1489, \"text\": \"* 2017 Polish Basketball League MVP\"}, \"D2S20\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1490, \"end\": 1523, \"text\": \"* 2018 FIBA Europe Cup Top Scorer\"}, \"D2S21\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1525, \"end\": 1551, \"text\": \"**Studies and References**\"}, \"D2S22\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1553, \"end\": 1790, \"text\": \"A study published in the Journal of Sports Science and Medicine in 2018 found that Bamforth's unique playing style, which combines speed, agility, and strength, has been instrumental in Bank BGŻ's success in the Polish Basketball League.\"}, \"D2S23\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1791, \"end\": 1794, \"text\": \"[1]\"}, \"D2S24\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1796, \"end\": 1966, \"text\": \"In an interview with Polish sports magazine, Przegląd Sportowy, Bamforth credited Bank BGŻ's coaching staff and training facilities for his rapid development as a player.\"}, \"D2S25\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1967, \"end\": 1970, \"text\": \"[2]\"}, \"D2S26\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1972, \"end\": 1986, \"text\": \"**References**\"}, \"D2S27\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1988, \"end\": 2017, \"text\": \"[1] Kowalski, J., & Nowak, M.\"}, \"D2S28\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2018, \"end\": 2025, \"text\": \"(2018).\"}, \"D2S29\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2026, \"end\": 2101, \"text\": \"Analysis of Scott Bamforth's playing style in the Polish Basketball League.\"}, \"D2S30\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2102, \"end\": 2157, \"text\": \"Journal of Sports Science and Medicine, 17(3), 251-258.\"}, \"D2S31\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2158, \"end\": 2180, \"text\": \"[2] Przegląd Sportowy.\"}, \"D2S32\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2181, \"end\": 2200, \"text\": \"(2019, January 15).\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"card_id\": \"d2:c0\", \"entity\": \"Scott Bamforth\", \"scope\": \"current\", \"claim\": \"Scott Bamforth currently plays for Bank BGŻ.\", \"answ